# {{ factory.factory.name }} — the Analysis Factory (v{{ factory.schema_version }})

A git-native, **domain-agnostic analysis factory**. Input: a raw product idea + a domain profile.
Output: reviewed, versioned, traceable analysis artifacts and **backend + frontend execution
plans**, delivered as packages to consumer repos. Boundary: **{{ factory.factory.boundary }}** — it
never implements, never audits implementations inside the line, never runs tests inside the line.

Everything below is generated from `factory.yaml` + `profiles/{{ profile.identity.id }}.yaml` by `gov.py render`.
The constitution that governs the repo is `shared/CONSTITUTION.md`.

## Layout
```
factory.yaml                 single source of truth: stages, passes, gates, lanes, paths, naming, ID grammar, marker grammar
{{ factory.paths.profiles }}/                    a domain is DATA — _schema.yaml + <id>.yaml (+ <id>/knowledge/*)
{{ factory.paths.domain }}/                      domain-profile.md saved from the conversational domain-profile stage = entry gate
{{ factory.paths.platform }}/                    P-1 output: project-registry.md
{{ factory.paths.engines }}/<id>/                the governed pipeline: SKILL.md (generated) + references/ENGINE.md (Jinja2 template)
{{ factory.paths.standalone }}/<id>/             outside the line, on demand, never a gate
{{ factory.paths.shared }}/                      the core doc set (tables generated in place)
{{ factory.paths.reviewers }}/pass-review.md     the single gate template
{{ factory.paths.decisions }}/<MOD>/             ADR stream
{{ factory.paths.modules }}/<MOD>/[vN/]          v1 = base folder, vN = delta only; {{ factory.paths.module.state_dir }}/ generated current state; {{ factory.paths.module.inputs_dir }}/ fetched inputs; {{ factory.paths.module.packages_dir }}/ split output
{{ factory.paths.commands }}/                    thin command wrappers (generated)
{{ factory.paths.tools }}/            config.py (loader) · gov.py (orchestrator) · toolkit/ (one parser/splitter/structure/archive) · tests/
history/                     pre-v6 artefacts, loaded by nothing
```

